   "source": [
    "# Wisconsin Diagnostic Breast Cancer Dataset Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook prepares the raw WDBC data, explores the dataset, creates correlation heatmaps, and performs a classification analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model comparison is designed to show **underfitting, a good fit, and overfitting** in the same way polynomial degrees were compared in the earlier regression notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Files in this project\n",
    "- `wdbc.data.txt` — raw dataset\n",
    "- `wdbc.names.txt` — dataset description\n",
    "- `wdbc_prepared.csv` — cleaned dataset with column names\n",
    "\n",
    "> This is an educational machine-learning analysis, not a clinical diagnostic tool.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
